ṁ,","e":"the perfected ones with defilements ended:","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"mn98:11.104","p":"tamahaṁ brūmi brāhmaṇaṁ.","e":"that’s who I declare a brahmin.","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"mn98:11.105","p":"Yassa pure ca pacchā ca,","e":"They have nothing before or after,","r":"sya13.648","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"mn98:11.106","p":"majjhe ca natthi kiñcanaṁ;","e":"or even in between.","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"mn98:11.107","p":"Akiñcanaṁ anādānaṁ,","e":"Having nothing, taking nothing:","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"mn98:11.108","p":"tamahaṁ brūmi brāhmaṇaṁ.","e":"that’s who I declare a brahmin.","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"mn98:11.109","p":"Usabhaṁ pavaraṁ vīraṁ,","e":"Captain of the herd, excellent hero,","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"mn98:11.110","p":"mahesiṁ vijitāvinaṁ;","e":"great seer and victor;","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"mn98:11.111","p":"Anejaṁ nhātakaṁ buddhaṁ,","e":"unstirred, washed, awakened:","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"mn98:11.112","p":"tamahaṁ brūmi brāhmaṇaṁ.","e":"that’s who I declare a brahmin.","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"mn98:11.113","p":"Pubbenivāsaṁ yo vedi,","e":"They who know their past lives,","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"mn98:11.114","p":"saggāpāyañca passati;","e":"see heaven and places of loss,","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"mn98:11.115","p":"Atho jātikkhayaṁ patto,","e":"and have attained the end of rebirth:","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"mn98:11.116","p":"tamahaṁ brūmi brāhmaṇaṁ.","e":"that’s who I declare a brahmin.","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"mn98:12.1","p":"Samaññā hesā lokasmiṁ,","e":"For name and clan are formulated","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"mn98:12.2","p":"nāmagottaṁ pakappitaṁ;","e":"as mere convention in the world.","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"mn98:12.3","p":"Sammuccā samudāgataṁ,","e":"Produced by mutual agreement,","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"mn98:12.4","p":"tattha tattha pakappitaṁ.","e":"they’re formulated in each case.","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"mn98:12.5","p":"Dīgharattānusayitaṁ,","e":"For a long time this misconception","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"mn98:12.6","p":"diṭṭhigatamajānataṁ;","e":"has prejudiced those who don’t understand.","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"mn98:12.7","p":"Ajānantā no pabrunti,","e":"Ignorant, they declare","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"mn98:12.8","p":"jātiyā hoti brāhmaṇo.","e":"that one is a brahmin by birth.","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"mn98:12.9","p":"Na jaccā brāhmaṇo hoti,","e":"You’re not a brahmin by birth,","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"mn98:12.10","p":"na jaccā hoti abrāhmaṇo;","e":"nor by birth a non-brahmin.","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"mn98:12.11","p":"Kammunā brāhmaṇo hoti,","e":"You’re a brahmin by your deeds,","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"mn98:12.12","p":"kammunā hoti abrāhmaṇo.","e":"and by deeds a non-brahmin.","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"mn98:12.13","p":"Kassako kammunā hoti,","e":"You’re a farmer by your deeds,","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"mn98:12.14","p":"sippiko hoti kammunā;","e":"by deeds you’re a professional;","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"mn98:12.15","p":"Vāṇijo kammunā hoti,","e":"you’re a trader by your deeds,","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"mn98:12.16","p":"pessako hoti kammunā.","e":"by deeds are you a servant;","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"mn98:12.17","p":"Coropi kammunā hoti,","e":"you’re a bandit by your deeds,","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"mn98:12.18","p":"yodhājīvopi kammunā;","e":"by deeds you’re a warrior;","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"mn98:12.19","p":"Yājako kammunā hoti,","e":"you’re a sacrificer by your deeds,","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"mn98:12.20","p":"rājāpi hoti kammunā.","e":"by deeds you’re a ruler.","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"mn98:13.1","p":"Evametaṁ yathābhūtaṁ,","e":"In this way the astute regard deeds","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"mn98:13.2","p":"kammaṁ passanti paṇḍitā;","e":"in accord with truth.","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"mn98:13.3","p":"Paṭiccasamuppādadassā,","e":"Seeing dependent origination,","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"mn98:13.4","p":"kammavipākakovidā.","e":"they’re expert in deeds and their results.","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"mn98:13.5","p":"Kammunā vattati loko,","e":"Deeds make the world go on,","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"mn98:13.6","p":"kammunā vattati pajā;","e":"deeds make people go on;","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"mn98:13.7","p":"Kammanibandhanā sattā,","e":"sentient beings are bound by deeds,","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"mn98:13.8","p":"rathassāṇīva yāyato.","e":"like a moving chariot’s linchpin.","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"mn98:13.9","p":"Tapena brahmacariyena,","e":"By fervor and spiritual practice,","r":"sya13.649","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"mn98:13.10","p":"saṁyamena damena ca;","e":"by restraint and by self-control:","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"mn98:13.11","p":"Etena brāhmaṇo hoti,","e":"that’s how to become a brahmin,","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"mn98:13.12","p":"etaṁ brāhmaṇamuttamaṁ.","e":"this is the supreme brahmin.","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"mn98:13.13","p":"Tīhi vijjāhi sampanno,","e":"Accomplished in the three knowledges,","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"mn98:13.14","p":"santo khīṇapunabbhavo;","e":"peaceful, with rebirth ended,","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"mn98:13.15","p":"Evaṁ vāseṭṭha jānāhi,","e":"know them, Vāseṭṭha,","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"mn98:13.16","p":"brahmā sakko vijānatan”ti.","e":"as the Divinity and Sakka to the wise.”","s":"B","l":"A"},{"i":"mn98:14.1","p":"Evaṁ vutte, vāseṭṭhabhāradvājā māṇavā bhagavantaṁ etadavocuṁ:","e":"When he had spoken, Vāseṭṭha and Bhāradvāja said to him,","s":"N","l":""},{"i":"mn98:14.2","p":"“abhikkantaṁ, bho gotama, abhikkantaṁ, bho gotama.","e":"“Excellent, worthy Gotama! Excellent!","s":"Vāseṭṭha","l":""},{"i":"mn98:14.3","p":"Seyyathāpi, bho gotama, nikkujjitaṁ vā ukkujjeyya, paṭicchannaṁ vā vivareyya, mūḷhassa vā maggaṁ ācikkheyya, andhakāre vā telapajjotaṁ dhāreyya ‘cakkhumanto rūpāni dakkhantī’ti; evamevaṁ bhotā gotamena anekapariyāyena dhammo pakāsito.","e":"As if he were righting the overturned, or revealing the hidden, or pointing out the path to the lost, or lighting a lamp in the dark so people with clear eyes can see what’s there, worthy Gotama has made the teaching clear in many ways.","s":"Vāseṭṭha","l":""},{"i":"mn98:14.4","p":"Ete mayaṁ bhavantaṁ gotamaṁ saraṇaṁ gacchāma dhammañca bhikkhusaṅghañca.","e":"We go for refuge to the worthy Gotama, to the teaching, and to the mendicant Saṅgha.","s":"Vāseṭṭha","l":""},{"i":"mn98:14.5","p":"Upāsake no bhavaṁ gotamo dhāretu ajjatagge pāṇupetaṁ saraṇaṁ gate”ti.","e":"From this day forth, may the worthy Gotama remember us as lay followers who have gone for refuge for life.”","s":"Vāseṭṭha","l":""},{"i":"mn98:14.6","p":"Vāseṭṭhasuttaṁ niṭṭhitaṁ aṭṭhamaṁ.","e":"","s":"N","l":""}]}]